      "observed": "REG2 output is on +3.3V, while +3V3 is a separate net. The FCC and NAVC VDD pins are listed on individual unconnected nets; neither MCU's VDD pins are connected to the regulator output. NAVC1.VBAT being on +3V3 does not connect its VDD pins.",
      "expected": "The 3.3 V regulator output should power both MCUs, with their VDD pins connected to that rail. The specification says the LD39200 produces 3V3 for the MCUs and sensors.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(node (ref \"REG2\") (pin \"1\") (pinfunction \"OUT\") (pintype \"unspecified\"))"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"1\") (name \"+3.3V\")"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"2\") (name \"+3V3\")"
