          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"146\") (name \"UART3_TX_FCC\") (class \"Default\") (node (ref \"FCC1\") (pin \"48\") (pinfunction \"VCAP\")"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "UART3 is not connected to UART GPIOs, and the MCU core-regulator output pins are exposed on the connector instead of being properly decoupled, risking failure of the FCC to operate correctly.",
      "confidence": 0.99
    },
    {
      "category": "wrong_value",
      "components": ["U5"],
      "pins": ["U5.7", "U5.8", "U5.9", "U5.5", "U5.14"],
      "nets": ["+3.3V", "I2C1_SCL_NAVC", "I2C1_SDA_NAVC", "unconnected-(U5-CSB2-Pad5)", "unconnected-(U5-CSB1-Pad14)"],
      "observed": "BMI088 PS (pin 7) is tied to +3.3V while its SCL/SCK and SDA/SDI pins are on the NAVC I2C bus; both chip-select pins are unconnected.",
      "expected": "The specification identifies the BMI088 as an I2C sensor. It should be configured for I2C operation, with the interface-selection and chip-select pins set to the levels required by the BMI088 datasheet.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(node (ref \"U5\") (pin \"7\") (pinfunction \"PS\") (pintype \"input\"))"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(node (ref \"U5\") (pin \"8\") (pinfunction \"SCL/SCK\") (pintype \"input\"))"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(node (ref \"U5\") (pin \"9\") (pinfunction \"SDA/SDI\") (pintype \"bidirectional\"))"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"299\") (name \"unconnected-(U5-CSB2-Pad5)\")"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"1\") (name \"+3.3V\")"
        },
        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "Bosch BMI088, I2C addr 0x19 (acc) / 0x69 (gyr)"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The BMI088 is configured for SPI rather than the specified I2C interface, so the NAVC's I2C bus is unlikely to communicate with the accelerometer and gyroscope.",
      "confidence": 0.97
    }
  ],
  "summary": "Anomalies are present. The netlist leaves both MCU VDD supplies unconnected from the LDO, routes FCC VCAP pins to UART3 connector signals, and configures the I2C-specified BMI088 for the wrong interface."
}

